  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.8,
      "size": 28800,
      "text": "我们从小数数，都是十个一数，满十就进一位。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.82,
      "size": 29088,
      "text": "为什么是十？也许只因为我们有十根手指。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.14,
      "size": 34272,
      "text": "数字 365，其实是三个一百、六个十、加五个一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "placevalue",
      "line_id": "def-1",
      "filename": "placevalue-def-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/placevalue-def-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.87,
      "size": 29952,
      "text": "这就是位值制：每一位的权重，是进制的一个幂。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "placevalue",
      "line_id": "def-2",
      "filename": "placevalue-def-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/placevalue-def-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.53,
      "size": 56448,
      "text": "十进制里，从右往左依次是一、十、百、千，也就是十的零次、一次、二次方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "placevalue",
      "line_id": "def-3",
      "filename": "placevalue-def-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/placevalue-def-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.17,
      "size": 34704,
      "text": "换一个进制，规则不变，只是把底数从十换成别的数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "binary",
      "line_id": "bin-1",
      "filename": "binary-bin-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/binary-bin-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.46,
      "size": 39312,
      "text": "计算机只认两种状态，开与关，于是用二进制，逢二进一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "binary",
      "line_id": "bin-2",
      "filename": "binary-bin-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/binary-bin-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.69,
      "size": 43056,
      "text": "每一位只有零和一，权重是二的幂：一、二、四、八、十六。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "binary",
      "line_id": "bin-3",
      "filename": "binary-bin-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/binary-bin-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.2,
      "size": 35136,
      "text": "比如 1101，就是八加四加一，正好等于十进制的十三。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "hex",
      "line_id": "hex-1",
      "filename": "hex-hex-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/hex-hex-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.72,
      "size": 27504,
      "text": "二进制太长，于是人们用十六进制来压缩它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "hex",
      "line_id": "hex-2",
      "filename": "hex-hex-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/hex-hex-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.19,
      "size": 34992,
      "text": "每四个二进制位，正好对应一个十六进制符号，从零到 F。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "interaction",
      "line_id": "int-1",
      "filename": "interaction-int-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/interaction-int-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.59,
      "size": 41472,
      "text": "输入一个数字，看它在二、八、十、十六进制下如何展开。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "interaction",
      "line_id": "int-2",
      "filename": "interaction-int-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/interaction-int-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.58,
      "size": 25344,
      "text": "注意同一个数，进制越小，位数就越多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.04,
      "size": 32688,
      "text": "进制只是选择一个底数，位值制的规则始终如一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.05,
      "size": 32832,
      "text": "每一位的权重都是底数的幂，各位相加就还原出原数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "number-bases",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/number-bases/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.89,
      "size": 30240,
      "text": "理解了位值，你就读懂了机器的语言，我们下次再见！"
    }
  ],
